  "description": "Secret retrieval for constrained hosts.\n\nSource distribution. The .cs files are compiled into the consuming assembly, for\nDataverse custom workflow activities and on-premises deployments, which cannot\nuse plug-in packages. For every other consumer, reference JMCL.Azure.Secrets instead.\n\nIMPORTANT: NuGet does not flow contentFiles transitively. Reference ALL of these\npackages directly, not just this one:\n  JMCL.Azure.Secrets.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.IocContainer.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.ProcessModel.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.Net.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.RestClient.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.Serialization.Sources",
